//images.unsplash.com/photo-1518495973542-4542c06a5843?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"ihlara-kamp","title":"Ihlara Vadisi Kamp","kind":"orman","region":"Aksaray","city":"Güzelyurt","lat":38.26,"lng":34.3,"elevationM":1200,"summary":"Kanyon tabanında Melendiz kenarı. Gölge ve su, yazın serin; çadır vadi girişinde.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501555088652-021faa106b9b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470071459604-3b5ec3a7fe05?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"erciyes-kamp","title":"Erciyes Tekir Kamp","kind":"yayla","region":"Kayseri","city":"Melikgazi","lat":38.55,"lng":35.52,"elevationM":2200,"summary":"Dağ etek kampı. Yazın serin çayır, kışın kayak; rüzgâr sert, su tesisten.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511497584788-876760111969?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1439066615861-d1af74d74000?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"aladaglar-kamp","title":"Demirkazık Kamp","kind":"yayla","region":"Niğde","city":"Çamardı","lat":37.84,"lng":35.12,"elevationM":1600,"summary":"Aladağlar milli park kapısı. Çadır köy üstü, zirve yürüyüşü; yazın çoban, kışın kar.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469474968028-56623f02e42e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472214103451-9374bd1c798e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1482192505345-5655af888cc4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"nemrut-kamp","title":"Nemrut Kamp","kind":"yayla","region":"Adıyaman","city":"Kahta","lat":37.98,"lng":38.74,"elevationM":1800,"summary":"Tümülüs altı yayla. Gün doğumu için gece çadır, rüzgâr sert, su az.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476041800959-2f6bb412c8ce?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445308394109-4ec2920981b1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1475924156734-496f6cac6ec1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1426604966848-d7adac402bff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"baskonus-kamp","title":"Başkonuş Yaylası","kind":"yayla","region":"Kahramanmaraş","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.5666,"lng":36.5838,"elevationM":1320,"summary":"Sedir-göknar yayla kampı. Yazın serin, çadır ve karavan düzlüğü; Maraş sıcağından kaçar.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470770841072-f978cf4d019e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500534314209-a25ddb2bd429?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1418065460487-3e41a6c84dc5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472396961693-142e6e269027?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"tekir-maras-kamp","title":"Tekir Yaylası","kind":"yayla","region":"Kahramanmaraş","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.885,"lng":36.623,"elevationM":1503,"summary":"Kayseri yolu vadi yaylası. Dere ve gölet kenarı çadır; gece ovadan soğuk.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525535-07fb3b4ae5f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1465695954255-a262b0f57b40?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470246973918-29a93221c455?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"kizilcahamam","title":"Soğuksu – Kızılcahamam","kind":"orman","region":"Ankara","city":"Kızılcahamam","lat":40.47,"lng":32.65,"elevationM":975,"summary":"Milli park çam kampı. Başkente yakın, kaplıca kasabası; yaz sonu sakin.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613487700156-bbde37f69132?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631740694409-580a251e4ab8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602391833977-358a52198938?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1471115853179-bb1d604434e0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"palandoken-kamp","title":"Palandöken Etek Kamp","kind":"yayla","region":"Erzurum","city":"Yakutiye","lat":39.85,"lng":41.28,"elevationM":2200,"summary":"Kayak dağı eteği yaz kampı. Çayır ve rüzgâr, su tesisten; gece soğuk.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576176539998-0237d1ac6a85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542273917363-3b1817f69a2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509316975850-ff9c5deb0cd9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500389783522-18c9d0d14cbc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"van-edremit-kamp","title":"Van Gölü Edremit Kamp","kind":"gol","region":"Van","city":"Edremit","lat":38.42,"lng":43.25,"elevationM":1650,"summary":"Göl kenarı çakıl kamp. Gün batımı açık, su tuzlu; yazın sıcak, rüzgâr öğleden sonra.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551120738-c3fcea8d0cf8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607348318282-6d2148bb296c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1440688807730-73e4e2169fb8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613297595539-0d36a37702c6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"tatvan-nemrut","title":"Nemrut Krater – Tatvan","kind":"gol","region":"Bitlis","city":"Tatvan","lat":38.62,"lng":42.24,"elevationM":2300,"summary":"Krater gölleri üstü yayla. Yazın çadır, manzara Van Gölü; gece çok soğuk.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1431965400057-a84b80cfdbff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593201464529-e286c575128c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1644676654534-abc4f62ceee1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]},{"id":"munzur-kamp","title":"Munzur Gözeleri","kind":"orman","region":"Tunceli","city":"Merkez","lat":39.14,"lng":39.5,"elevationM":1000,"summary":"Göze ve vadi kampı. Buz gibi su, çınar gölgesi; milli park kuralına uy.","images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1483728642387-6c3bdd6c93e5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519681393784-d120267933ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470252649378-9c29740c9fa8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502082553048-f009c37129b9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"],"videos":[]}]'),l9=JSON.parse('[{"id":"baskonus-yaylasi","title":"Başkonuş Yaylası","kind":"kamp","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.5666,"lng":36.5838,"elevationM":1320,"summary":"Andırın yolu üzerindeki Avgasır sırtında, sedir ve göknar gölgesinde serin bir yayladır. Çadır ve karavan için düzlükler var; yazın şehir sıcağından kaçmak için en bilinen Maraş duraklarından biri.","videos":[{"youtubeId":"1krfCTwlMCE","title":"Kahramanmaraş yaylalarında çadır kampı"}],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501555088652-021faa106b9b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470071459604-3b5ec3a7fe05?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511497584788-876760111969?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"yavsan-yaylasi","title":"Yavşan Yaylası","kind":"yayla","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.4825,"lng":36.7028,"elevationM":1650,"summary":"Sır Barajı güneyindeki sedir–göknar kuşağında, yaklaşık 1650 metrede bir tabiat parkıdır. İlkbaharda çiçekli, yaz öğleden sonraları serin; kısa yürüyüş ve piknik için uygundur.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1439066615861-d1af74d74000?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469474968028-56623f02e42e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472214103451-9374bd1c798e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1482192505345-5655af888cc4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"kapicam-tabiat-parki","title":"Kapıçam Tabiat Parkı","kind":"doga","city":"Dulkadiroğlu","lat":37.492,"lng":37.032,"elevationM":610,"summary":"Gaziantep yolu kenarında, merkeze yakın kızılçam ve göletli bir tabiat parkıdır. Botanik bahçe, kısa yürüyüş yolları ve piknik gölgesi aynı yerde; günübirlik doğa için en kolay adres.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476041800959-2f6bb412c8ce?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445308394109-4ec2920981b1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1475924156734-496f6cac6ec1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1426604966848-d7adac402bff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470770841072-f978cf4d019e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500534314209-a25ddb2bd429?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"tekir-yaylasi","title":"Tekir Yaylası","kind":"kamp","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.8852,"lng":36.6225,"elevationM":1503,"summary":"Kayseri yolu üzerindeki Tekir, dere ve çam arasında serin bir vadi yaylasıdır. Yazın gölet kenarına çadır iner; gece havası ovadan belirgin biçimde soğuktur.","videos":[{"youtubeId":"XirCXtmexxA","title":"Tekir Yaylası genel manzara"}],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1418065460487-3e41a6c84dc5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472396961693-142e6e269027?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525535-07fb3b4ae5f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1465695954255-a262b0f57b40?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470246973918-29a93221c455?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"yesilgoz-mesire","title":"Yeşilgöz","kind":"doga","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.9176,"lng":36.617,"elevationM":1385,"summary":"Tekir Vadisi’nde turkuaz obruk gölüyle tanınır. Su mağara kaynağından gelir, yazın bile buz gibi kalır. Kıyıdaki çınar–çam gölgesi kısa bir mola ve fotoğraf için yeter.","videos":[{"youtubeId":"xBvFxKBoBcc","title":"Kahramanmaraş Yeşilgöz vlog"},{"youtubeId":"q-eYFbuutLQ","title":"Döngel Mağarası ve Yeşilgöz"}],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613487700156-bbde37f69132?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631740694409-580a251e4ab8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602391833977-358a52198938?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1471115853179-bb1d604434e0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576176539998-0237d1ac6a85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542273917363-3b1817f69a2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"dongel-magarasi","title":"Döngel Mağarası","kind":"doga","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.8593,"lng":36.6413,"elevationM":1130,"summary":"Tekir tarafında karstik yamaçta bağlı mağaralar ve ceviz–çınar örtüsü vardır. Köy deresi gölge verir; yazın serin, kısa ve fotojenik bir doğa durağır.","videos":[{"youtubeId":"aygzVuHQAls","title":"Döngel Mağarası’ndan kesit"},{"youtubeId":"q-eYFbuutLQ","title":"Döngel Mağarası ve Yeşilgöz"}],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509316975850-ff9c5deb0cd9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500389783522-18c9d0d14cbc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551120738-c3fcea8d0cf8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607348318282-6d2148bb296c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1440688807730-73e4e2169fb8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613297595539-0d36a37702c6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"ali-kayasi-menzelet","title":"Ali Kayası Cam Teras","kind":"manzara","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.748,"lng":36.796,"elevationM":990,"summary":"Bulutoğlu sırtında Menzelet Baraj Gölü’ne bakan kayalık bir seyirdir. Cam teras Ceyhan vadisinin mavi düzlüğünü karşıya alır; kısa yürüyüş, geniş manzara.","videos":[{"youtubeId":"Sp_sfuLVJ1Y","title":"Kahramanmaraş keşif gezisi"}],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1431965400057-a84b80cfdbff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593201464529-e286c575128c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1644676654534-abc4f62ceee1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1483728642387-6c3bdd6c93e5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519681393784-d120267933ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"berit-dagi","title":"Berit Dağı","kind":"manzara","city":"Göksun","lat":38.0776,"lng":36.8779,"elevationM":3054,"summary":"Göksun’un güneydoğusunda 3054 metrelik rüzgârlı bir Toros zirvesidir. Çavdarbeli’nden sonra çıplak sırt ve yaz yaylaları başlar; ufuk Elbistan ovasına açılır.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470252649378-9c29740c9fa8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502082553048-f009c37129b9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493246507139-91e8fad9978e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1473773508845-188df298d2d1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1447752875215-b2761acb3c5d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518495973542-4542c06a5843?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"engizek-dagi","title":"Engizek Dağı","kind":"manzara","city":"Çağlayancerit","lat":37.776,"lng":37.263,"elevationM":2814,"summary":"Çağlayancerit kuzeyinde sedir ormanının doğu ucu sayılan yüksek bir sırt kütlesidir. Etekte meşe ve karaçam, yukarıda bozkır ve yaz otlakları görülür.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501555088652-021faa106b9b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470071459604-3b5ec3a7fe05?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511497584788-876760111969?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"cokak-geben-orman","title":"Çokak Yayla Ormanı","kind":"yayla","city":"Andırın","lat":37.7361,"lng":36.3287,"elevationM":1235,"summary":"Andırın’ın kuzeyinde karaçam ve meşe ile çevrili bir çöküntü yaylasıdır. Pınarlar mahalle çevresinden çıkar; Geben yönündeki orman kuşağı kısa sırt turuna yeter.","videos":[{"youtubeId":"Aazs32fe6ns","title":"Andırın ve Kahramanmaraş gezisi"}],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1439066615861-d1af74d74000?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469474968028-56623f02e42e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472214103451-9374bd1c798e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1482192505345-5655af888cc4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"ahir-dagi-etek","title":"Ahır Dağı","kind":"manzara","city":"Dulkadiroğlu","lat":37.605,"lng":36.98,"elevationM":720,"summary":"Şehrin hemen kuzeyindeki dağ, alçakta kızılçam, yukarıda sedir ve ardıç kuşaklarıyla yükselir. Etekten bakınca Maraş ayak altında kalır.","videos":[{"youtubeId":"Sp_sfuLVJ1Y","title":"Kahramanmaraş keşif gezisi"}],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476041800959-2f6bb412c8ce?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445308394109-4ec2920981b1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1475924156734-496f6cac6ec1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1426604966848-d7adac402bff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470770841072-f978cf4d019e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500534314209-a25ddb2bd429?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"binboga-keklikoluk","title":"Keklikoluk Yaylası","kind":"yayla","city":"Göksun","lat":38.203,"lng":36.46,"elevationM":1850,"summary":"Binboğa’nın güney yamacında, 1850–2100 metre arası dağ çayırı ve seyrek ardıçtır. Yaz başında sürü çıkar; ufuk Sarız ve Göksun çaylarına açılır.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1418065460487-3e41a6c84dc5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472396961693-142e6e269027?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525535-07fb3b4ae5f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1465695954255-a262b0f57b40?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470246973918-29a93221c455?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"nurhak-dagi","title":"Nurhak Dağı","kind":"manzara","city":"Nurhak","lat":38.0469,"lng":37.483,"elevationM":3081,"summary":"İlçenin kuzeyinde 3000 metreyi aşan kayalık bir zirvedir. Tek Ardıç ve Ali Gölü üzerinden plato açılır; göl kar suyuyla yaz ortasına kadar durur.","videos":[{"youtubeId":"oQX-r9RSTGU","title":"Nurhak Dağı"},{"youtubeId":"9ql-Hy4rYhs","title":"Nurhak Dağı Göbeliği"}],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613487700156-bbde37f69132?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631740694409-580a251e4ab8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602391833977-358a52198938?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1471115853179-bb1d604434e0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576176539998-0237d1ac6a85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542273917363-3b1817f69a2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"hartlap-orman","title":"Hartlap Ormanı","kind":"doga","city":"Onikişubat","lat":37.5455,"lng":36.6941,"elevationM":820,"summary":"Sandal ağacı ve karışık makiden ormana geçen serin bir mahalle sırtıdır. Gökçe Dağı ormanı kısa döngü verir; yazı merkezden serin, kışın ıslak çamur olur.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509316975850-ff9c5deb0cd9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500389783522-18c9d0d14cbc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551120738-c3fcea8d0cf8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607348318282-6d2148bb296c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1440688807730-73e4e2169fb8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613297595539-0d36a37702c6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"yedikuyular","title":"Yedikuyular","kind":"manzara","city":"Dulkadiroğlu","lat":37.642,"lng":37.036,"elevationM":1835,"summary":"Ahır Dağı’nın 1800–2000 metre bandındaki açık sırt düzlüğüdür. Yazın çayır ve bakış, kışın kar; Milcan yönü ovayı ve Engizek silsilesini gösterir.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1431965400057-a84b80cfdbff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593201464529-e286c575128c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1644676654534-abc4f62ceee1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1483728642387-6c3bdd6c93e5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519681393784-d120267933ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"halbur-yaylasi","title":"Halbur Yaylası","kind":"kamp","city":"Andırın","lat":37.6625,"lng":36.4453,"elevationM":1453,"summary":"Andırın–Göksun yolu yakınında çam ve açık otlak karışımı bir ipek yolu yaylasıdır. Su gözeleri düzlüktedir; yazın serin kamp ve kısa yürüyüş için elverişlidir.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470252649378-9c29740c9fa8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502082553048-f009c37129b9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493246507139-91e8fad9978e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1473773508845-188df298d2d1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1447752875215-b2761acb3c5d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518495973542-4542c06a5843?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"kirksu-yaylasi","title":"Kırksu Yaylası","kind":"kamp","city":"Andırın","lat":37.7782,"lng":36.3585,"elevationM":1480,"summary":"Geben batısında onlarca soğuk su gözesinin birleştiği orman–yayla koridorudur. Aşağıda çam gölgesi, yukarıda açık çayır; çadır düzlüğü boldur.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501555088652-021faa106b9b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470071459604-3b5ec3a7fe05?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511497584788-876760111969?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72"]},{"id":"karagol-degirmendere","title":"Değirmendere Karagöl","kind":"doga","city":"Göksun","lat":37.8703,"lng":36.4591,"elevationM":1780,"summary":"Göksun güneyinde kar suyuyla oluşan küçük bir dağ gölüdür. İlkbaharda çiçek ve kalan kar bir arada durur; kıyı taşlı çayır, manzara vadiye iner.","videos":[],"images":["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1439066615861-d1af74d74000?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469474968028-56623f02e42e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472214103451-9374bd1c798e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=72","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1482192505345-5655af888cc4?aut